{% prose key="people-development-7" %}

## #Find your Greatness Vol 4:{% br /%} Leadership Projektteams.

In diesem Workshop geht es darum, dass die Führungskraft eine Methodenkompetenz erlernt, um Teams möglichst schnell kraftvoll und wirksam werden zu lassen. Das ist besonders dann wichtig, wenn im Rahmen von Projekten permanent neue Teams entstehen. Da braucht die Führungskraft neben dem fachlichen Know How insbesondere exzellente Führungsqualitäten. Es geht um Wertebildung und gelebter Kultur im Team, genauso wie um die konstruktive Konfliktfähigkeit und Transparenz.

{% /prose %}

{% heading key="people-development-8" %}

## Das sagen meine Kunden.

{% /heading %}

{% prose key="people-development-9" %}

## Ulrike Hallegger, Vice President Rooms Operations & Services,{% br /%} Marriott Hotel Holding GmbH Europe

In March I provided my team with the opportunity to attend the Refuel Your Energy Workshop facilitated by Susanne Preiss. I cannot tell you how excited I am about that experience almost three months later. This holistic program strengthend our team spirit and built a solid foundation for reducing stress, increasing energy, and promoting overall wellbeing at work and at home.

I wanted to take a moment and reiterate the core principles that our team practiced during the workshop:

1\. What is impacting our day to day work life and making mindful choices

2\. Meditation Exercises that increase your quality of life and are easy to execute on a daily basis

3\. Removing yourself from socially added stress factors and prioritizing on the key attributes at home and at work

The benefits to our team are clear and I would encourage everyone to seek out opportunities like this one. Your teams will benefit, you will benefit, and your company will benefit from the increased productivity and job satisfaction.

{% /prose %}

